{"Title":"An Act relative to the charter of the town of Rockland","BillNumber":"H4036","DocketNumber":"HD4413","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"DFD1","Name":"David F. DeCoste","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DFD1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-13T14:37:37.68"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DFD1","Name":"David F. DeCoste","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DFD1","ResponseDate":"2023-06-13T14:37:37.68"},{"Id":"JFK0","Name":"John F. Keenan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JFK0","ResponseDate":"2023-06-22T13:23:14.7733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4036/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative DeCoste of Norwell, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4036) of David F. DeCoste and John F. Keenan (by vote of the town) relative to changing the name of the board of selectmen to select board in the town of Rockland.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section C-2.02 of article II of the charter of the town of Rockland, which is on file in the office of the archivist of the commonwealth, as provided in section 12 of chapter 43B of the General Laws, is hereby amended by striking out the title and inserting in place thereof the following title:- Select Board.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section C-2.02 of said article II of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the word “Selectmen” or “selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 3. Subsection A of said section C-2.02 of said article II of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of”.\r\n\tSECTION 4. Section C-2.17 of said article II of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 5. Section C-2.18 of said article II of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 6. Subsection (a) of said section C-2.18 of said article II of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “the selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- the select board.\r\n\tSECTION 7. Subsection (b) of said section C-2.18 of said article II of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “3 selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- 3 members of the select board.\r\n\tSECTION 8. Section C-2.19 of said article II of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 9. Section C-3.02 of article III of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 10. Section C-3.03 of said article III of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 11. Section C-3.05 of said article III of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 12. Section C-4.02 of article IV of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 13. Section C-4.03 of said article IV of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 14. Said section C-4.03 of said article IV of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the word “selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 15. Section C-6.02 of article VI of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 16. Section C-6.03 of said article VI of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 17. Section C-6.04 of said article VI of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 18. Section C-6.07 of said article VI of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 19. Subsection (d) of said section C-6.07 of said article VI of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen’s” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board’s.\r\n\tSECTION 20. Section C-7.01 of article VII of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “Selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 21. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}